; Split-horizon zone for mail.peetvandesande.com.
;
; This name exists publicly as a CNAME to an OVH VPS (ruby,
; vps-5ca50660.vps.ovh.net, 145.239.73.18). Ruby only serves mail on its
; WireGuard addresses: 993 answers there and times out on the public address,
; so a client that resolves the public name simply hangs.
;
; It names ruby's wg0 addresses, because those are the only ones that carry
; submission: Postfix binds 587/465 on wg0 alone (wireguard/ruby's master.cf),
; while the dummy0 addresses offer 993, 4190 and 25 and refuse 587/465. This
; zone answered dummy0 until 2026-10-23, and Mail on the LAN could receive but
; not send - "unable to connect using SSL on the default ports" is a refused
; 465. All of 993, 4190, 587 and 465 answer on both wg0 addresses from the LAN,
; checked that day, and the submission certificate carries
; DNS:mail.peetvandesande.com, so the one name serves both directions.
;
; Both addresses are reachable from the LAN over wgclient1: wg1's peer allowed
; IPs carry 192.168.204.0/24 and fd33:5692:1834:204::/64, and the router marks
; the v4 prefix into table 1001 - see router/README.md and wireguard/README.md.
; Nothing here routes; this only names them.
;
; The zone is deliberately the SINGLE NAME, not peetvandesande.com - a zone for
; the parent would shadow www and everything else in the domain with an empty
; internal zone. peetvandesande.com is DNSSEC-signed, so this override needs a
; matching addNTA() on Delphi or every lookup here SERVFAILs.
;
; GENERATED by dns/ansible - do not edit this file by hand.
; The source is dns/ansible/group_vars/all.yml. Change it there and run
;   cd dns/ansible && ansible-playbook zones.yml
; which rewrites this file, bumps the serial only if the contents changed,
; pushes it to Pythia and reloads just this zone.
$TTL 3600
$ORIGIN mail.peetvandesande.com.

@       IN  SOA pythia.home. hostmaster.home. (
                2026102301  ; serial
                3600        ; refresh
                900         ; retry
                604800      ; expire
                3600 )      ; negative TTL

@       IN  NS      pythia.home.

@       IN  A       192.168.204.254          ; ruby's wg0, over wgclient1
@       IN  AAAA    fd33:5692:1834:204::254  ; ruby's wg0, over wgclient1
